1
00:00:00,186 --> 00:00:03,186
(Raj:)Also, what kind of name is Biff?

2
00:00:03,189 --> 00:00:05,689
(Raj:)Sounds like when you pop open
a can of Pillsbury dough.

3
00:00:05,691 --> 00:00:08,161
(Howard:)Biff.

4
00:00:09,829 --> 00:00:12,829
(Howard:)Oh, that stuff is so good
wrapped around cocktail weenies.

5
00:00:12,832 --> 00:00:13,832
(Leonard:)Guys...

6
00:00:13,833 --> 00:00:15,033
(Sheldon:)Do you know that
the word "wiener"

7
00:00:15,034 --> 00:00:16,204
(Sheldon:)comes from the German name

8
00:00:16,202 --> 00:00:17,632
(Sheldon:)of the Austrian capital
Vienna, or "Wien"?

9
00:00:17,637 --> 00:00:19,907
(Raj:)Do you know if you look
at Austria on a map

10
00:00:19,906 --> 00:00:21,206
(Raj:)it actually looks like a wiener?

11
00:00:22,875 --> 00:00:23,975
(Leonard:)Guys, what are
we doing?

12
00:00:23,976 --> 00:00:25,176
W-We sent the girls away

13
00:00:25,177 --> 00:00:26,347
(Leonard:)so we could focus.

14
00:00:26,345 --> 00:00:29,385
(Sheldon:)I don't think it worked.

15
00:00:33,986 --> 00:00:36,056
(lively dance music playing)

16
00:00:40,159 --> 00:00:44,399
(Amy:)Maybe after this, you'll be
in the mood for some Manilow.

17
00:00:44,397 --> 00:00:47,397
(Bernadette:)I think after this,
I'll be dead.

18
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:49,470
(Amy:)Look at us out,

19
00:00:49,468 --> 00:00:51,298
(Amy:)while Penny's in
the room studying.

20
00:00:51,304 --> 00:00:52,574
(Bernadette:)I'm proud of her.

21
00:00:52,571 --> 00:00:53,771
(Bernadette:)This is a great opportunity.

22
00:00:53,773 --> 00:00:55,573
(Bernadette:)It's nice to see her take it
seriously.

23
00:00:55,574 --> 00:00:56,574
(Leonard:)It is.

24
00:00:56,575 --> 00:00:57,575
(Amy:)But enough about Penny.

25
00:00:57,576 --> 00:00:59,376
(Amy:)Let's talk about us.

